  <div class="card-body">
    <h5 class="card-title"> About Student Management System </h5>
    <p class="card-text">
      
       Student Management System is a web-based application developed to simplify and organize the process of managing student information.
       The main purpose of this system is to provide an easy and efficient way to store and manage student records in one place.
       The system allows users to add new student records, view existing information, update student details, and delete records when required. 
       By keeping all the information organized digitally, the system helps reduce manual paperwork and makes accessing student information faster and easier.
       This application provides a simple and user-friendly interface so that student information can be managed without unnecessary complexity. 
       It can be useful for educational institutions, administrators, teachers, and other users who need to maintain student records.<br>
       The Student Management System is developed using Java, JSP, Servlets, HTML, CSS, Bootstrap, and a database.<br> 
       The project demonstrates how different web technologies can work together to create a functional database-driven application.<br>
       
       Our goal is to make student record management simple, organized, and efficient.<br><br>
      <b> Thank You.</b>
